[en.CHARACTER_FANCY_PANTS_NAME]
Fancy Pants

[en.CHARACTER_FANCY_PANTS_DESC]
Fancy Pants is the highest ranking pony in Canterlot, aside from the former Princesses and the current Queen. As the current Supreme Chairpony of the Empire’s Royal Committee, the leader of the central government of the Equestria Empire, the social core of Canterlot’s upper class society, and the representative of a noble swan, Fancy Pants knows the value of power: it’s all about location, location, location. And when you’re standing next to either a Princess or a Queen, you’ve got the right location.

[zh.CHARACTER_FANCY_PANTS_NAME]
花花短裤

[zh.CHARACTER_FANCY_PANTS_DESC]
除去曾经的公主和现在的女皇外，花花短裤是坎特洛特城地位最高的小马。现任小马利亚帝国皇家委员会最高委员长、小马利亚帝国中央政府的领导者、坎特洛特上流社会的核心、一只尊贵天鹅的代表，花花短裤，懂得权力的道理：权力正如地产，重要的是位置、位置、还是位置。当你站在不论是公主还是女皇的身边，你就选对了一个合适的位置。
